<title>USA: Boca Research says operating chief resigns.</title>
<headline>Boca Research says operating chief resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boca Research Inc said Monday that Lawrence Steffann had resigned as chief operating officer to found a technology venture fund.</p>
<p>It said Steffann's responsibilities will be split between the other senior members of its executive management team.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
